what is going on everybody welcome back  to the cosmic wonder I'm Warren Thompson  and we have some insanely sad news today  in the world of DC Henry Cavill is not  going to be returning as Superman after  all James Gunn and Peter Safran were  recently announced the new co-ceos of DC  Studios and when they came in they  started to shake things up a little bit  Unfortunately they came in after Black  Adam and Black Adam Dwayne The Rock  Johnson and Henry Cavill had every  intention on bringing Superman back and  they did he was in the post-credits  scene and it seemed like he was back for  good and Dwayne talked about how much he  fought with the studio to get him to  come back however like I said that was  before James Gunn and Peter Safran took  over now unfortunately today Henry  Cavill has released an official  statement telling us all that he is not  going to be back as Superman here's what  he posted to his Instagram he said I  have just had a meeting with James Gunn  and Peter saffron and it's sad news  everyone I will after all not be  returning as Superman after being told  by the studio to announce my return back  in October prior to their hire this news  isn't the easiest but that's life The  Changing of the Guard is something that  happens I respect that James and Peter  have a universe to build I wish them and  all involved with the newest Universe  the best of luck and the happiest of  Fortunes for those who have been by my  side through the years we can mourn for  a bit but then we must remember Superman  is still around everything he stands for  still exists and the examples he sets  for us are still there my turn to where  the cape has passed but what Superman  stands for never will it's been a fun  ride with you all onwards and upwards  again this is super sad to hear but this  was a very very classy and tasteful  Announcement by Henry Cavill he handled  this perfectly you know it's hard on him  you know it's hard for him to deal with  this but despite how hard it might be  for him he is handling it with such  class also I might add that I kind of  feel stupid now because I met him at the  Avatar Premiere when we were in the  theater and I shook his hand and told  him that I was really happy that he was  back a Superman I feel really bad now  although it sounds like he just had a  meeting with them today so unfortunately  we thought they were going to be keeping  him around James Gunn even talked about  how important Superman was in the DC  Universe and he did talk about how he  praised Henry Cavill as Superman but  unfortunately they are coming into a  universe that needs to be rebuilt and it  kind of sounds like James Gunn is  planning on starting from scratch it  makes you wonder what the future holds  for the rest of these franchises that  are coming out or have recently came out  like Black Adam is The Rock still going  to be Black Adam in the DCU it also  makes you question what we thought we  knew Dwayne The Rock Johnson said that  Black Adam was the first movie in their  phase one he announced that DC was doing  phases now however Dwayne announced that  and that was before James Gunn and Peter  saffron took over and since the rock is  the one who brought Superman back and  claimed that it was back that didn't  mean much because unfortunately the rock  is not in charge and Peter Sab Fran and  James Gunn came in and said Superman is  now gone at least Henry Cavill is  Superman we can expect another Superman  to be in the universe James Gunn has  already expressed that Superman is very  important and in this Henry Cavill even  says that Superman is still around  everything that he stands for still  exists in the examples he sets for us  are still there and he simply states  that his turn to where the Cape is over  so it looks like they'll be bringing in  a new Superman but with the news that  James Gunn is canceling Wonder Woman 3  it makes us wonder if Gal Gadot is done  as Wonder Woman now if he was willing to  let cavil go as Superman he is most  likely willing to let Godot go as Wonder  Woman and it sounds like he might  actually be starting from Ground Zero  when he builds his new DC Universe so as  unfortunate as it is it sounds like  nobody is really safe in the DC Universe  that we know however James Gunn did  tweet a poster for a Blue Beetle so I'm  gonna go ahead didn't say Blue Beetle is  okay I'm also going to assume movies  that don't exist in the main DC Universe  like Joker 2 and the Batman and all of  the Batman spin-offs like the penguin  villain series I'm gonna assume they're  okay as well because they don't directly  affect the universe that James Gunn is  trying to build James Gunn has already  expressed that movies TV shows and  including anything that is going to be  on a streaming service and even video  games are all going to be connected to  one Universe although he did say not all  video games are going to be connected  but James Gunn has a plan unfortunately  that plan does not include Henry Cavill  Superman so this is a very sad day I  really really did love Henry Cavill the  Superman I loved Man of Steel a lot of  people didn't but I did I thought it was  amazing and I really loved him as  Superman he was perfect to me and I'm  sure to a lot of different people as  well so this is sad news but let me know  your thoughts about this in the comments  down below and to keep up with the  latest DC news be sure to subscribe and  hit that notification Bell you can  follow us on Instagram Twitter as well  and as always thank you all so much for  watching wolf
 

